===== Todo 16 (Wave 3): --plan-memory QA (definitive) =====
command (full pipeline): polykernel-opt test/plan_memory.mlir --infer-shapes --fuse-rmsnorm-matmul --infer-tile-layout --plan-memory | FileCheck test/plan_memory.mlir
command (fallback):      polykernel-opt test/plan_memory.mlir --infer-shapes --plan-memory | FileCheck test/plan_memory.mlir --check-prefix=FALLBACK

MEMORY MODEL (documented in lib/Passes/PlanMemory.cpp):
  smem_bytes      = (tile_m*tile_k + tile_k*tile_n) * dtype_bytes * stages
                    tile_m/n/k from polykernel.tile_* attrs (ABSENT -> fallback 16x16x16);
                    dtype_bytes = operand-0 element width/8 (bf16/fp16=2, fp32=4); stages=2 (double-buffer).
  workspace_bytes = 0 for a fused op (carries polykernel.fused_from; eliminated intermediates fused away),
                    else numElements(result) * dtype_bytes (standalone result = global working set).
  over-budget     = smem_bytes > 163*1024 (166912 bytes, sm_80 per-block budget) -> polykernel.smem_over_budget=true + warning.
  layout          = polykernel.layout is READ (fallback row_major), not hardcoded; baseline footprint is layout-agnostic.

